                        Text#1285 "Unverified social media posts from the channel RCF also claimed a substation hit that caused a blackout in Leningrad oblast, air-defense missile interceptions over Omsk, and three Russian helicopters lost at Ust-Luga; none of these claims has been independently confirmed "
