                        Text#1341 "Pilots of Ukraine's 412th Nemesis Brigade struck a Russian drone base at Donetsk Airport that was used to launch \"Shaheds\" at Ukraine "
                        Text#1342 [reader-cite-ref-d1eb526eb128] " 92 " label="Source 92" (press)
                        Text#1343 ". "
