                        Text#1346 "."
                    View#1347
                      Text#1348 [reader-block-b55] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1349 "The exchange is part of a sustained campaign rather than a one-off: Russia has attacked Ukraine's energy sector 128 times in the past week, leaving roughly 850,000 people without power ahead of winter, according to Ukraine's Ministry of Energy and power company DTEK "
                        Text#1350 [reader-cite-ref-5b19e1311a7d] " 34 " label="Source 34" (press)
                        Text#1351 " "
                        Text#1352 [reader-cite-ref-4844350490a6] " 94 " label="Source 94" (press)
                        Text#1353 ". "
                        Text#1354 "Ukrainian air defenses said they intercepted 276 drones overnight, but strikes still caused impacts at 31 locations, with Kyiv, Dnipro, Sumy, Donetsk and Kherson oblasts facing the most acute energy crises "
                        Text#1355 [reader-cite-ref-71997f7175dd] " 95 " label="Source 95" (press)
                        Text#1356 " "
                        Text#1357 [reader-cite-ref-e02aff46cd51] " 34 " label="Source 34" (press)
                        Text#1358 ". "
                        Text#1359 "The outages continued into Nov 10, with emergency power cuts reported in Kyiv and the Kharkiv, Poltava and Sumy oblasts "
                        Text#1360 [reader-cite-ref-8cf6256139c5] " 96 " label="Source 96" (press)
                        Text#1361 ". "
