                        Text#1363 [reader-cite-ref-8a96d7cdabc5] " 97 " label="Source 97" (press)
                        Text#1364 ". "
                        Text#1365 "As of 9:40 on Nov 11, emergency power cuts were still in effect in Kharkiv oblast, with the energy situation also remaining difficult in Kyiv, Dnipropetrovsk and Odesa oblasts, according to the Ministry of Energy "
                        Text#1366 [reader-cite-ref-a2abba7cb736] " 98 " label="Source 98" (press)
                        Text#1367 " "
                        Text#1368 "."
                    View#1369
                      Text#1370 [reader-block-b56] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1371 "A Ukrainian Military Intelligence unit commander told Ukrinform that striking targets 1,500 kilometers inside Russia will soon no longer count as a deep strike, since it is already difficult to find unprotected targets at that range "
                        Text#1372 [reader-cite-ref-0f8b878ff6a7] " 99 " label="Source 99" (press)
                        Text#1373 "."
                    View#1374
                      Text#1375 [reader-block-b57] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1376 "Overnight, Russian forces hit five large power substations in Poltava, Dnipropetrovsk, Vinnytsia and Kirovohrad oblasts, according to Prime Minister Serhiy Koretskyi, who said social facilities and residential buildings were also struck "
                        Text#1377 [reader-cite-ref-443371505098] " 100 " label="Source 100" (press)
                        Text#1378 ". "
                        Text#1379 "At least two people were killed and nine injured in those attacks "
                        Text#1380 [reader-cite-ref-aea3fd36f744] " 100 " label="Source 100" (press)
                        Text#1381 ". "
                        Text#1382 "Russia also attacked six large electricity substations in Vinnytsia, Kirovohrad, Zhytomyr and Cherkasy oblasts, according to Koretskyi, and transmission lines were damaged in Kirovohrad and Rivne oblasts "
                        Text#1383 [reader-cite-ref-c03f3545a76a] " 101 " label="Source 101" (press)
                        Text#1384 " "
                        Text#1385 "."
                    View#1386
                      Text#1387 [reader-block-b58] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1388 "Russia struck six major power substations on Nov 11, causing outages across Ukraine; substations were hit in Vinnytsia, Kirovohrad, Zhytomyr and Cherkasy oblasts, and power lines were damaged in Kirovohrad and Rivne oblasts, according to Prime Minister Serhiy Koretskyi "
                        Text#1389 [reader-cite-ref-5f24fc86661a] " 102 " label="Source 102" (press)
                        Text#1390 " "
                        Text#1391 "."
                    View#1392
                      Text#1393 [reader-block-b59] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1394 "The Ukrainian Ministry of Energy said Russia had attacked energy infrastructure in eight regions, with the situation most critical in Kyiv, Dnipropetrovsk and Odesa regions "
                        Text#1395 [reader-cite-ref-d240373d4eb6] " 103 " label="Source 103" (press)
                        Text#1396 ". "
