                        Text#1398 [reader-cite-ref-44e3b3985fc3] " 104 " label="Source 104" (press)
                        Text#1399 ". "
                        Text#1400 "Ukraine's power supply is close to critical as Russian strikes bring darkness and cold, the BBC reports "
