                        Text#1421 " "
                        Text#1422 " "
                        Text#1423 ". "
                        Text#1424 "The strikes are also reaching industrial infrastructure: Kernel Holding, Ukraine's largest producer and exporter of sunflower oil, said its production sites, equipment, and storage tanks had been damaged by Russian drones and shut down all processing plants "
