                        Text#1430 "The strikes come as trilateral Russia-Ukraine-US talks are set for Abu Dhabi on Tuesday, with Kyiv announcing a new mechanism to deploy EU funds faster for energy repairs after Zelenskyy agreed to \"activate a special emergency mechanism\" with European Commission president Ursula von der Leyen "
