                        Text#1434 [reader-cite-ref-c771ec484de1] " 111 " label="Source 111" (press)
                        Text#1435 ". "
                        Text#1436 "On the ground, the fighting is ongoing: Ukraine's General Staff reported 127 clashes along the front line on Nov 9, with the Pokrovsk sector the hottest, and said Russian forces suffered a record 2,980 killed and severely wounded in a single day, the highest daily toll since the full-scale invasion "
