                        Text#1439 [reader-cite-ref-dd4e3123619a] " 113 " label="Source 113" (press)
                        Text#1440 ". "
                        Text#1441 "The General Staff reported 167 combat clashes over Nov 11, with Russian forces losing 2,150 soldiers killed and wounded, and quoted the Russians' use of 7,137 kamikaze drones, 84 airstrikes and 2,371 strikes on settlements and military positions "
                        Text#1442 [reader-cite-ref-114a31d969e0] " 114 " label="Source 114" (press)
                        Text#1443 " "
                        Text#1444 ". "
                        Text#1445 "Meduza's analysis of the drone war notes that drone saturation is causing major coordination issues in Ukraine, with incentives pushing drone operators to strike prematurely and units refusing to switch off jammers for their own safety, undermining neighboring infantry assaults "
                        Text#1446 [reader-cite-ref-60a1c1ca745d] " 115 " label="Source 115" (press)
                        Text#1447 ". "
                        Text#1448 "CNN separately published Ukrainian footage of how Russia struck an underground shelter "
