                        Text#1450 "."
                    View#1451
                      Text#1452 [reader-block-b64] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1453 "Zelensky has discussed preparations by communities across Ukraine for the winter period amid continued Russian attacks with mayors from different parts of the country, and said the talks will be regular "
                        Text#1454 [reader-cite-ref-c1de933c075d] " 117 " label="Source 117" (press)
                        Text#1455 ". "
