                        Text#1458 "."
                    View#1459
                      Text#1460 [reader-block-b65] (contextmenu)
                        Text#1461 "A Mastodon post claimed that \"the United States can make this war stop any day, but refuses to do so\" "
                        Text#1462 [reader-cite-ref-74711bf68550] " 119 " label="Source 119" (press)
                        Text#1463 ". "
